      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALL IT BLING (2) was a beaten favourite here last time out but had little go his way, drawing wide and working before sticking on for second. Much better served by this barrier and he possesses the gate speed to take advantage. That will see him hard to catch. MAGIC JUJON (7) came from wider on this row when she he won here three back and has been solid since. Her strike rate at this circuit stands at 50 per cent and she draws for a trail so could threaten. LOSTANDFOUND (3) led and fought well to go under narrowly last start. He can be prominent again from another good draw. Last-start winners MOONSHINE MILLY (9) and HIGHNMIGHTY (11) are both exotic hopes with even luck from back row draws.",
